        <li>&#10003; International coverage</li>
        <li>&#10003; Personal account manager</li>
        <li>&#10003; Corporate &amp; family plans</li>
      </ul>
      <a href="/signup" style="display:block;padding:11px;background:var(--dark);color:#fff;text-align:center;border-radius:8px;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;text-decoration:none">Contact us</a>
